  - m_Id: 5707318296725
    m_Localized: Exit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5707318296726
    m_Localized: Already did that
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5707318296727
    m_Localized: Updated
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5707318296728
    m_Localized: The killer will notice your repeated moves and adapt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5707318296729
    m_Localized: I did it, perfect timing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5707318296730
    m_Localized: I can time the hammer strike with the thunder
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5707318296731
    m_Localized: This will be loud, I can't hit it right now
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5707318296732
    m_Localized: I hit it too late, I'll get caught
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5707318296733
    m_Localized: Shove the screwdriver in to force the lock.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5707318296734
    m_Localized: Move it around until the screwdriver jams.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5707318296735
    m_Localized: I hit it too early, I'll get caught
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5707318296736
    m_Localized: I hit it too late, I'll get caught
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5707318296737
    m_Localized: It's stuck, try again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5707318296738
    m_Localized: Butcher saw you hiding.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5707318296739
    m_Localized: You made too much noise.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5707318296740
    m_Localized: You kept hiding in the same spot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5707318296741
    m_Localized: You failed to mask Hammer noise with thunder.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5707318296742
    m_Localized: Butcher saw you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5707318296743
    m_Localized: You were caught.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5707318296744
    m_Localized: Restart
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5707318296745
    m_Localized: Main Menu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5707318296746
    m_Localized: Butcher ambushed you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5707318296747
    m_Localized: Lockpicks let you keep your progress after getting caught.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5707318296748
    m_Localized: Lockpick
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5707318296749
    m_Localized: Picked up Lockpick
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5707318296750
    m_Localized: Continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5707318296751
    m_Localized: Hold right mouse click to apply pressure
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5707318296752
    m_Localized: Use your mouse to move the lockpick and press left mouse button
      to pick pins
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5707318296753
    m_Localized: Pin set
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5707318296754
    m_Localized: Unlocked key
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5707318296755
    m_Localized: The door is chained.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5707318296756
    m_Localized: When I got caught the first time, he chained the door with a padlock.
      I wish I had taken that hairpin on top of that toilet. Maybe I could've used
      it as a lockpick.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5707318296757
    m_Localized: I must keep an eye out to find more lockpicks
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34286902860185600
    m_Localized: A lockpick... I could pick that padlock with this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34286903040540672
    m_Localized: Another lockpick. If he catches me, I can use it to get out of the
      cage again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34292293547458560
    m_Localized: Picked up Lighter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34292666949566464
    m_Localized: Lighter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34365368158781440
    m_Localized: Find the right direction, then pull the screwdriver that way until
      the lock breaks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34392063293128704
    m_Localized: I have to get out of here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34396260386340864
    m_Localized: What kind of place is this?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34614680490999808
    m_Localized: I need a flame to light it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34614680591663104
    m_Localized: I should light the lighter first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 35779292372533248
    m_Localized: The bar for the vise isn't here. Last time I saw it, it was by the
      cage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 35880272732749824
    m_Localized: I gotta hide.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36824656387112960
    m_Localized: Light the Candles
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36824656521330688
    m_Localized: You can use the lighter to light up the candles around you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36824656521330689
    m_Localized: OK
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36908069135712256
    m_Localized: Stay Quiet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36908069202821120
    m_Localized: In some areas you have to watch how much noise you make, or they
      might hear you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
